  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商業分析",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要為教授商業分析的方法和步驟以及如何將商業分析應用在商業營運企劃案的撰寫，並藉由相關設計案例的互動學習與討論來有效率地提升學生的專案提案能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The work of business analysis is to determine the business needs, current capabilities, and define the business case before the project charter is created. The aim of this course is to teach students how to implement the work of business analysis through case study and interactive discussion.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
